  "final_messages": [
    "I\u2019ll read `retry-delay.js` and any repository guidance before editing.",
    "The module is a small stub. I\u2019ll add validation and capped jitter.",
    "The implementation is in place; I\u2019ll review the file before committing.",
    "The commit is clean. I\u2019ll run the named acceptance check.",
    "Acceptance caught overflow with tiny bases. I\u2019ll fix the exponent calculation.",
    "The revised calculation handles tiny bases and zero values; I\u2019ll commit it.",
    "All 28 acceptance cases pass. I\u2019ll publish the ready PR.",
    "{\"summary\":\"Implemented and committed `retryDelay` in `retry-delay.js`. The acceptance check passed all 28 cases, and ready PR #7 is open.\",\"findings\":[{\"statement\":\"`retry-delay.js:3` retains the CommonJS export, applies the requested defaults, and rejects invalid `attempt`, `baseMs`, and `maxMs` values with `RangeError` without mutating options.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"art_c4b363f2-49fd-461a-a0e5-e6da0fc929a1\"],\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"statement\":\"`retry-delay.js:16` returns zero without sampling for attempt 0. Positive attempts validate one random sample and calculate floored, capped jitter with bounded exponentiation for tiny bases and huge attempts.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"art_c4b363f2-49fd-461a-a0e5-e6da0fc929a1\",\"art_1c38cdc8-5515-4f1b-af81-6c28556adc5a\"],\"confidence\":\"high\"},{\"statement\":\"Commit `dd07da57e2ebdd4922f2142b8a5cc10a65628704` passed the named `acceptance` check (28 cases); ready PR #7 is open.\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"art_a9f794b2-fdaf-4664-8e34-757c307f216f\",\"art_1c38cdc8-5515-4f1b-af81-6c28556adc5a\",\"art_8cf1843a-67c5-406d-8eb4-ffd439011fb6\"],\"confidence\":\"high\"}],\"uncertainties\":[],\"recommendations\":[],\"evidence_refs\":[{\"ref\":\"instructions\",\"source\":\"instructions\"},{\"ref\":\"inputs.repository_binding\",\"source\":\"inputs\"},{\"ref\":\"art_c4b363f2-49fd-461a-a0e5-e6da0fc929a1\",\"source\":\"artifact\",\"artifact_id\":\"art_c4b363f2-49fd-461a-a0e5-e6da0fc929a1\"},{\"ref\":\"art_a9f794b2-fdaf-4664-8e34-757c307f216f\",\"source\":\"artifact\",\"artifact_id\":\"art_a9f794b2-fdaf-4664-8e34-757c307f216f\"},{\"ref\":\"art_1c38cdc8-5515-4f1b-af81-6c28556adc5a\",\"source\":\"artifact\",\"artifact_id\":\"art_1c38cdc8-5515-4f1b-af81-6c28556adc5a\"},{\"ref\":\"art_8cf1843a-67c5-406d-8eb4-ffd439011fb6\",\"source\":\"artifact\",\"artifact_id\":\"art_8cf1843a-67c5-406d-8eb4-ffd439011fb6\"}]}"
